mw2coop patch for maps/roadkill.gsc (Team Player, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Ride end: the second player gets off too (the gunner may be player 2).
@@@ replace
	org = level.player.origin;
//	level.player FreezeControls( true );
@@@ with
	maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::ride_ends();
	org = level.player.origin;
//	level.player FreezeControls( true );
@@@ end

2. Crash: player 2 lands next to player 1.
@@@ replace
	level.player SetOrigin( player_slide_crash.origin );
@@@ with
	level.player SetOrigin( player_slide_crash.origin );
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		level.player2 thread maps\_mw2coop::teleport_to_partner_when_safe( level.player, 5 );
@@@ end

3. After the crazy ride enemies see both players again, not only player 1
   (maps\_mw2coop::players_ignoreme).
@@@ replace
	level.player.ignoreme = false;
@@@ with
	maps\_mw2coop::players_ignoreme( false );
@@@ end
